Mary-O Lite

This repository reuses and adapts original source artwork, rig/keyframe
positions, and LDtk map data from the Ambition project, which distributes its
sources under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Retained source assets:
  assets/svg/mary_o_v2.svg
    Ambition tools/ambition_sprite2d_renderer/assets/mary_o_v2.svg
  assets/svg/player-robot-v3.svg
    Ambition tools/ambition_sprite2d_renderer/ambition_sprite2d_renderer/
    data/characters/player_robot_v3_svg/player-robot-v3.svg
  assets/worlds/mary_o.ldtk
    Ambition game/ambition_map_assets/ambition_demo_mary_o/worlds/mary_o.ldtk
  assets/rigs/*.json
    Adapted from Ambition's Python SVG paper-doll animator into readable
    frame/part descriptions usable directly by Python.

The Pygame simulation, level importer, rig interpolator, raster cache tool,
original synthesized music and sound effects, lessons, and other code in
Mary-O Lite are new implementations inspired by the corresponding Ambition
systems. The new implementation is simpler, and is not the Ambition engine.

PNG/WAV files generated by the tools are cache artifacts, not source, and are
excluded from Git and from the distributed source archive.

Additional adapted Ambition artwork source code (all regenerable Python):
  tools/ambition_art/common.py
    .../targets/super_mary_o_common.py
  tools/ambition_art/draw.py
    Minimal alpha-safe draw adapter for the original painters.
  tools/ambition_art/{model,art,cosmic_art,cosmic_animation}.py
    .../targets/characters/{_mary_o_v2_model,_mary_o_v2_art,
    _mary_o_v2_cosmic_art,mary_o_v2_cosmic}.py
  tools/ambition_art/tiles.py
    .../targets/tiles/super_mary_o_tileset.py
  tools/ambition_art/props.py
    .../targets/props/super_mary_o_props.py
  tools/ambition_art/{construction,lift,spark}.py
    .../targets/props/{super_mary_o_construction,
    super_mary_o_lift,super_mary_o_spark}.py
  tools/ambition_art/{ai_slop,solid_snake,snake_plant,void_star,void_lizard}.py
    Ambition sprite renderer's same-named character painter modules.
  assets/svg/{european_swallow,african_swallow}.svg
    .../data/characters/<species>/<species>.svg

These painters have had their Ambition package imports and sheet-publishing
plumbing adapted to work standalone, while preserving geometry, palettes,
and source animation timing. The generated cache stays excluded from Git.

Additional adapted original Ambition sources in this fidelity pass:
  tools/ambition_art/snakes_on_planes.py
    .../targets/characters/_snakes_on_planes_common.py
    Original flying paper-plane and Cartesian-plane snake rig and clips.
  tools/ambition_art/fire_orb.py
    .../targets/props/entities.py::fire_orb, void_orb
    The rotating Fire Bar ball and the Void Lizard's shot.
  tools/ambition_art/coconut.py
    .../targets/props/coconut.py
    The source-generated Laden Swallow coconut projectile.

